{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/08/7248121/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてごめんなさーい（；＿；）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね、乃木坂でファースト写真集を出すことになったんですよ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はそれの撮影でまるで修学旅行のような日々が終わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"た、楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、数日全力すぎてなんだか疲労感がはんぱじゃありませんのよ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蚊に刺されたとこはかっゆいし...。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず完成を楽しみに待っててください( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、\nわたくしは明日のお仕事のために"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝ます！！！！！ばいならー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/08/7248121/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイス。"}],"source":"archive"}